   "event": "final",
   "answer": "**NVIDIA and AMD both flag competition and reliance on outside manufacturing; only NVIDIA's export-control risk has direct news support.**\n\n| Risk | NVIDIA | AMD |\n|---|---|---|\n| Competition | Competition could reduce market share [5] | Highly competitive and rapidly evolving markets [2] |\n| Manufacturing | Reliance on third-party foundries [7] | Reliance on third-party manufacturing [6] |\n\nNVIDIA tells cloud clients to limit China exposure under export controls [3]. Its 10-K says export controls restrict sales of advanced chips to China [1]. Quarterly gaming revenue doubled on record console demand [unverified].\n\n---\n*Not investment advice. Sources: SEC EDGAR filings (10-K, 8-K, XBRL) and NewsAPI headlines, as cited above.*\n*Claims marked [unverified] could not be matched to any retrieved source.*",
